    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## MASEO worker - agent_graph.py in n8n\nRuns the queued jobs of the web app, **one at a time**. `Claim next job` asks the **MASEO atomic service** for the oldest queued job; then each orange node is **one node of maseo_atomic's LangGraph** (`MASEOPipeline.build_graph`), run by the service with the **unchanged maseo_atomic code** (agents on Ollama, `config.yaml`, `models.py`, the five MCP servers). The IF/Switch nodes are the graph's edges.\n\nWhen the job ends (or fails), `Start next job` calls this workflow's webhook again. One execution = one job; open it to see every node's `output`, `log`, `next`, `route`, `position`.\n\nThe web app: port 8080 (webapp/app.py), backed by the workflow *MASEO web app + API*.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 1100,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "7affaa8e-88ff-58c9-ae2f-ebcc1cef3116",
      "name": "Note: how it works",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Requirements phase and OntoGeneration\nA switched-off agent is skipped exactly as `build_graph` skips it.",
        "height": 500,
        "width": 2640,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "d748a9ea-8e62-5780-aebe-6ae6b26619eb",
      "name": "Note: requirements phase",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        860,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Validation loop (check_tool / correct_ontology / advance)\nEvery round runs the tools in order; a failing tool is corrected up to `run.tool_retries` times. A round with no findings ends the loop; otherwise a verification pass follows, then the next round (up to `run.loop_rounds`).",
        "height": 1160,
        "width": 1780,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "190cf9fd-1071-5592-9a9c-0acc6b4ad755",
      "name": "Note: validation loop",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3540,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Failures\nThe error output of every graph node lands here: the job is marked failed (the web app shows where and why), the next queued job starts, the execution ends red.",
